            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.6.14+LEV.6.15+LEV.6.16+LEV.6.17+LEV.6.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 6.14-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And Moses said to Aaron and to Eleazar and Ithamar, his sons who were left, “Take the cereal offering that remains of the offerings by fire to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and eat it unleavened beside the altar, for it is most holy; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "you shall eat it in a holy place, because it is your due and your sons' due, from the offerings by fire to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; for so I am commanded. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.7.30+LEV.7.31+LEV.7.32+LEV.7.33+LEV.7.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 7.30-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " But the breast that is waved and the thigh that is offered you shall eat in any clean place, you and your sons and your daughters with you; for they are given as your due and your sons' due, from the sacrifices of the peace offerings of the people of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The thigh that is offered and the breast that is waved they shall bring with the offerings by fire of the fat, to wave for a wave offering before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and it shall be yours, and your sons' with you, as a due for ever; as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has commanded.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now Moses diligently inquired about the goat of the sin offering, and behold, it was burned! And he was angry with Eleazar and Ithamar, the sons of Aaron who were left, saying, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Why have you not eaten the sin offering in the place of the sanctuary, since it is a thing most holy and has been given to you that you may bear the iniquity of the congregation, to make atonement for them before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, its blood was not brought into the inner part of the sanctuary. You certainly ought to have eaten it in the sanctuary, as I commanded.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Aaron said to Moses, “Behold, today they have offered their sin offering and their burnt offering before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; and yet such things as these have befallen me! If I had eaten the sin offering today, would it have been acceptable in the sight of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when Moses heard that, he was content.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
